	(text "STM32H743VIT6. Pin map follows PX4 FMUv6C; see pinmap.md for every pin's alternate-function check.\nDecoupling per ST AN4938: 100 nF per VDD pin + 4.7 uF bulk, 2.2 uF per VCAP, VDDA through a ferrite.\nBOOT0 bridge enters ST ROM DFU on a blank chip. SCK/CLK series resistors sit at the MCU."
